 "etapas": [
  {
   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "The most",
     "texto": [
      "A very common form of the superlative is **самый** + adjective: **самый красивый** («the most beautiful»), **самая интересная** («the most interesting»), **самое дорогое** («the most expensive thing»), **самые большие** («the biggest»). **Самый** and the adjective agree with the noun in gender, number and case.",
      "There are also one-word forms, such as **крупнейший** («the largest», in size), **величайший** («the greatest») and **наименьший** («the smallest»; the minimum). They are learned along with each adjective.",
      "With a comparative + **всех** («of all») you express «the most…»: **Он старше всех** («He is the oldest of all»)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "From among several",
     "texto": [
      "To say «from among» use **из** + genitive: **самый умный из нас** («the cleverest of us»).",
      "For «as many as» use **столько же, сколько**; after **столько** the noun usually goes in the genitive plural: **У меня столько же книг, сколько у тебя** («I have as many books as you»)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
